      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": 99,
          "name": "盜賊首領",
          "text": "可恨啊....我的弓弩手還不來。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "completion_flag": 0,
      "condition": 2,
      "role_id": 54,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": 11,
          "name": "志超",
          "text": "妳的弓弩隊也不怎麼樣嘛。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "completion_flag": 15,
